<title>USA: Frisch's Restaurants sets 4 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Frisch's Restaurants sets 4 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frisch's Restaurants Inc said Tuesday it set a four percent stock dividend for shareholders of record on December 2.</p>
<p>The dividend is to be paid out on December 27.</p>
<p>The company has about 6,874,478 common shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
